flowchart LR
    A["Developer<br>with a requirement<br>e.g. 'Add GSMA Device Check lost/stolen<br>validator to /api/imei/{imei}/validate'"]
    B[Project Brain]
    C{"100% confident?<br>WHY/WHAT/<br>WHERE/HOW"}
    D[Clarifying<br>questions]
    E[Structured<br>Implementation Plan]
    F[Affected files<br>+ paths]
    G[Sequenced steps<br>+ conventions]
    H[Risks<br>+ severity]
    I[Cited sources<br>no assumptions]

    A -->|requirement + projectId| B
    B --> C
    C -- No --> D
    D -. developer answers .-> B
    C -- Yes --> E
    E --> F
    E --> G
    E --> H
    E --> I

    style A fill:#e0eef7,stroke:#006ebb,color:#000
    style B fill:#006ebb,stroke:#003f96,color:#fff
    style E fill:#e0eef7,stroke:#006ebb,color:#000
    style D fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#ffa000,color:#000
